{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117004","id":3347274982,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Hg1zm","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117004","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117004.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117004.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117004","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117004/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117004/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117004/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/500a697fedd6dc478c9bc24e18056d7b7b096e4a","number":117004,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add `@deprecated` and `@experimental` annotations to GDScript","user":{"login":"shoyguer","id":42917725,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyOTE3NzI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42917725?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyguer","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyguer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyguer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyguer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyguer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyguer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyguer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyguer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyguer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyguer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyguer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes godotengine/godot-proposals#6559.\r\nRelated to godotengine/godot-proposals#12105 and #104955.\r\n\r\nGDScript currently supports `## @deprecated:` and `## @experimental:` as doc comment tags. They show up in autocomplete and the class reference. \r\nBut setting a property or function as \"deprecated\" or \"experimental\" does nothing at the language level, no warnings are triggered, and no feedback reaches the dev.\r\n\r\nMy PR adds `@deprecated` and `@experimental` as GDScript annotations and makes the editor show warnings when properties or function members are called (also show on in-godot documentation).\r\n\r\n### New features added\r\n- Adds 2 new annotations: `@deprecated` and `@experimental`, both accepting an **optional** message string.\r\n- The annotations work on classes, functions, variables, etc.\r\n- `@warning_ignore(\"deprecated_member_used\")` and `@warning_ignore(\"experimental_member_used\")` work with the existing warning system.\r\n\r\n### Usage\r\n<img width=\"917\" height=\"913\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3086968e-3c0d-47f6-8035-72cd1295d30b\" />\r\n\r\nWarnings shown when hovering over code:\r\n<img width=\"805\" height=\"149\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/925d85c9-c41c-447f-88f1-cf315077b99e\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"774\" height=\"111\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c9e83ee9-3a5d-411c-9472-fcc8f8667f57\" />\r\n\r\nWarnings shown when running the game:\r\n<img width=\"1316\" height=\"110\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c711eb5-3f5c-406c-ab78-db998b428902\" />\r\n\r\nHow it looks on in-godot documentation:\r\n<img width=\"1161\" height=\"838\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/80997cfa-dd75-46cb-8cba-da427f97b137\" />\r\n<img width=\"998\" height=\"426\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9098d8ac-2dd0-46ae-8b8a-f71d5aceb349\" />\r\n\r\n### Addressing prior work\r\nPR #100174 decided, at the time, not to register `@deprecated` and `@experimental` as real annotations because \r\n\r\n> declaring a class member deprecated/experimental does nothing at the language level.\r\n\r\nAnd this worked for the scope of that PR, though akien-mga said in that same thread that proper language-level support was always the intended from the beginning. So I decided to create this PR to take this step for GDScript-defined members.\r\n\r\nPR #104955 (currently open) adds a `DEPRECATED_IDENTIFIER` warning that fires when doc-comment-tagged members are accessed. This PR is different: the annotations will directly mark the member as deprecated or experimental at the language level), instead of reading that status from doc comment data\r\nIn my honest opinion, both approaches are complementary: #104955 focus on using of already-deprecated doc-comment-tagged members, while my PR give the devs a proper annotation syntax with compile-time feedback from the start.\r\n\r\ngodotengine/godot-proposals#6559. proposed adding `@deprecated` as a real annotation. godotengine/godot-proposals#12105 proposed adding a warning when deprecated identifiers are used. This PR addresses both.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milesto